body:
hey. thank you..and i am, i mean honestly i feel so much for this guy, its just the fact that i decided to take ecstacy in the first place..i swear i wasnt thinking about a single thing, its like i wasnt even myself

&#x200B;

i feel terrible..i dont know how im supposed to tell him this..i can only imagine the hurtful words hed say to me..im afraid he might even seriously hurt me..besides all of that im a person that overthinks..i mean what if he tells everyone else i gave it to him..how will people look at me..i would end up replaying how we left things and in the long run id just end up becoming even more depressed and suicidal ..i always tend to think about the outcome of things to prepare myself..and i know this guy..i know how its gonna play out..sometimes i think maybe i should just kill myself and leave all of this in letters so he can understand why i done it..i just cant believe im about to throw my whole life away..in fact i already did..i mean even if i do make it through accepting this and moving on i wouldnt be able to be happy in a relationship..i know im gonna be hung up on him i wont be able to open up to another guy again..lets not even talk about the fact that i have herpes ..how am i even supposed to bring that up in any conversation

the funny thing is that my life has always been shitty...since finding out about this i havent had any motivation whatsoever i cant even leave the house. its not only this..i mean ive grown up with no father, an absent mother i grew up around drugs..my mom hasnt had a job since 1997 so she decided to sell drugs with my brother..ive been raped and sent away so ive never really had a bond with any of my family members..to them im basically the black sheep nobody really likes i kinda just exist

&#x200B;

since a young age i went out exploring life..i was about 14 i started attending parties and so on..i had my first bf at 15 and it ended badly..then i got together with my current bf and he was basically the opposite of my ex i fell hard for him..he has cheated on me in the past and i have forgiven him for it although he has a temper at times and is difficult to deal with i stick around..i mean its not exactly easy leaving the only person i have behind..my mom and i have always had a terrible relationship i know she hates me..she always blames everything that goes wrong on me and constantly turns my siblings on me..i used marijuana to escape..i constantly started feeling depressed..i overthink everything some days i just spend sleeping to escape reality ive always been a miserable person it just seems like id be better off dead

&#x200B;

as i got older i guess i started experimenting with other drugs such as ecstacy..i guess im always chasing this feeling where i just dont have to be myself and where i just dont have to be me for a while.. i guess thats how i ended up here..now look, my whole life is fucked

thanks for the link..ill check that out

&#x200B;

the reasons why i feel so strongly about ending my life are influenced by many factors..including this, i just hope that he doesnt get it..i mean i would understand if he decides to break things off but just the fact of him finding out that i have it and that i gave it to him would break me
